1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,320
Thailand embraces in its bosom all people of Thai blood,

2
00:00:05,320 --> 00:00:10,500
Every inch of Thailand belongs to the Thais.

3
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:15,760
It has long maintained its sovereignty,

4
00:00:15,760 --> 00:00:21,160
Because the Thais have always been united.

5
00:00:21,160 --> 00:00:26,640
The Thai people are peace-loving, But they are no cowards at war.

6
00:00:26,640 --> 00:00:31,880
Nor shall they suffer tyranny.

7
00:00:31,880 --> 00:00:37,420
All Thais are ready to give up every drop of blood,

8
00:00:37,420 --> 00:00:43,080
For the nation's safety, freedom and progress.